From a7881b4322f6e999ff5b88003ab0d712cb3d7d3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 14:41:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Outreach: check the site and confirm the email of unchecked
 prospects
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a 'Провери сайта и имейла на непроверените' button (and creatium:outreach-check)
that runs the site check and marks an email as published only when it is on the
business's own domain (or a free mailbox) and is actually found on their site.
Others stay unchecked with a reason; big platforms like notino.bg are flagged.
Harvey re-imports no longer undo a checked email status.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H9zcZYecprmixY9PhXginK
